prs.manualTesting:
1. Generate the Svelte sandbox. It needs `--no-link`, because a linked Svelte sandbox does not render:
   ```bash
   yarn task sandbox --template svelte-vite/default-ts --start-from auto --no-link
   ```
2. In `../storybook-sandboxes/svelte-vite-default-ts/src/stories/`, add two story files.

   `RenderErrors.stories.ts` (no `component`, so the story renders nothing):
   ```ts
   export default {
     title: 'Example/RenderErrors',
     tags: ['autodocs'],
   };

   export const NoComponent = {
     render: () => ({}),
   };
   ```
   `ArgsUpdateError.stories.ts`:
   ```ts
   import Button from './Button.svelte';

   export default {
     title: 'Example/ArgsUpdateError',
     component: Button,
     args: { label: 'Button', primary: false },
     decorators: [
       (storyFn, { args }) => {
         if (args.primary) {
           throw new Error('The decorator threw on an args update');
         }
         return storyFn();
       },
     ],
   };

   export const Default = {};
   ```
3. Start Storybook:
   ```bash
   cd ../storybook-sandboxes/svelte-vite-default-ts && yarn storybook
   ```
4. Open http://localhost:6006/?path=/docs/example-rendererrors--docs. The story block should show `Expecting a Svelte component from the story: "No Component" of "Example/RenderErrors".` On `next` the block is empty.
5. Open http://localhost:6006/?path=/story/example-rendererrors--no-component. The canvas should show the same error. On `next` the canvas is blank.
6. Open http://localhost:6006/?path=/story/example-argsupdateerror--default and set `primary` to `True` in Controls. The canvas should show the "The decorator threw on an args update" error. On `next` the canvas keeps the old button, and the error only appears in the browser console as uncaught. Set `primary` back to `False`: the button should render again.
7. Check for regressions in the update path: on `Example/Button` stories, change a few controls in the canvas and on the docs page. The button should follow each change with no error and no stuck loader.
